4a0d5f3b2bbaaef239f4abe.mp4?t=1751367815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br>\u25a0 Real time PvP by multiplay<br><br>\u25a0 Realistic virtual sports experiences by advanced physics</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514840/extras/17c5ceabe77f11d6c69f0c00ba1175ae.poster.avif?t=1751367815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514840/extras/17c5ceabe77f11d6c69f0c00ba1175ae.webm?t=1751367815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514840/extras/17c5ceabe77f11d6c69f0c00ba1175ae.mp4?t=1751367815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br>\u25a0 Player customization <br><br>\u25a0 Simple UI and easy control can help anyone to play<br><br>\u25a0 5 different difficulties from beginner to professional<br><br>* The game format is the same as the official Olympic rules, so you can learn sports training and rules.<br>* Suitable for virtual reality sports classrooms that must be conducted indoors due to physical education facilities and weather conditions.</li></ul>",
